OL,3,AEcuador intelligence chief and five
OL,4,AAmericans killed in Kenya helicopter
OL,5,Acrash
OL,6,
OL,7,FEcuador's intelligence chief and his
OL,8,Fwife were killed in a helicopter crash
OL,9,Fin Kenya on Wednesday.
OL,11,FFive Americans were also killed in the
OL,12,Fcrash, a US State Department
OL,13,Fspokesperson has confirmed.
OL,15,FMichele Sensi-Contugi and his wife
OL,16,FStephany Hollihan were among the seven
OL,17,Fpeople killed when the accident
OL,18,Fhappened in Samburu county at
OL,19,Fapproximately 09:13 local time (06:13
OL,20,FGMT).
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
